OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC called brothel and sex
OL,4,Alines on days off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Kent Police officer who worked
OL,7,Finvestigating modern slavery and human
OL,8,Ftrafficking would have been dismissed
OL,9,Ffor contacting brothels and adult sex
OL,10,Fwebsites on his days off had he not
OL,11,Falready retired, a watchdog says.
OL,13,FThe Independent Office of Police
OL,14,FConduct (IOPC) found PC Trevor Bonett
OL,15,Fhad twice called a brothel in the
OL,16,FMaidstone area on his personal mobile.
OL,18,FPhone data also revealed that he called
OL,19,Fsex lines or adult sex websites while
OL,20,Fon annual leave or rest days between
OL,21,FJanuary and June 2024.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
