OL,4,Alines on days off
OL,5,
OL,6,FIOPC director of engagement, Emily
OL,7,FBarry, said Bonett was trained to
OL,8,F"effectively safeguard sex workers" but
OL,9,Finstead used them for "his own personal
OL,10,Fgratification".
